  "details": "Having the option to exclude yourself from being captured by a VRChat camera. \n\nIt would stop so many problems in game. If I could just turn on a setting that did not allow another users in game camera to see me no matter what or turn on friends only camera mode.\n\n- Opt out of unsolicited pictures is basically the idea here.\n\n- Gives yourself another route of privacy and safety.\n\nIt could work like culling for avatars in your safety shield settings or be its own little control panel.",
